      "integrity": "sha512-+DAyd7uWgSibjxiTtC/SFODt/TdNrrmS9dSAYP53VNAhA6sFcJATp1qPNhG/31coVM+mb5HmZD5rwX60MC/cCQ==",
      "shasum": "293aec6bb30a0edb74cb3eaf7417aba6d8036885"
